#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Renderer"
msgstr "Renderer"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Software"
msgstr "Perangkat lunak"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Which renderer draws the game. Applies on the\n"
"next launch - save settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Renderer mana yang menggambar game. Berlaku pada\n"
"peluncuran berikutnya - simpan pengaturan lalu buka ulang."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Window size"
msgstr "Ukuran jendela"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Lebar"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Tinggi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "1x (native)"
msgstr "1x (asli)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "8x (4K)"
msgstr "8x (4K)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D render scale"
msgstr "Skala render 3D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Internal 3D rendering resolution. Higher is crisper 3D\n"
"(2D/HUD stays sharp). GPU backends only; the software\n"
"renderer stays native. Applies on the next launch - save\n"
"settings and relaunch."
msgstr ""
"Resolusi render 3D internal. Lebih tinggi = 3D lebih tajam\n"
"(2D/HUD tetap tajam). Hanya backend GPU; renderer perangkat\n"
"lunak tetap asli. Berlaku pada peluncuran berikutnya -\n"
"simpan pengaturan lalu buka ulang."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinear"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Integer"
msgstr "Bilangan bulat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Nearest"
msgstr "Terdekat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Sharp-bilinear"
msgstr "Bilinear tajam"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D scaling"
msgstr "Penskalaan 2D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"How the frame is magnified to the window.\n"
"Sharp-bilinear keeps 2D text crisp without the shimmer\n"
"nearest shows at non-integer window sizes. Integer snaps\n"
"to a whole multiple (pixel-perfect, with black bars).\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Cara frame diperbesar ke jendela.\n"
"Bilinear tajam menjaga teks 2D tetap tajam tanpa kedipan\n"
"yang muncul pada terdekat di ukuran non-bulat. Bilangan bulat\n"
"menyesuaikan ke kelipatan utuh (piksel sempurna, dengan bilah\n"
"hitam). Berlaku langsung."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "16:9 (widescreen)"
msgstr "16:9 (layar lebar)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "4:3 (arcade)"
msgstr "4:3 (arcade)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Square pixels"
msgstr "Piksel persegi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stretch"
msgstr "Regangkan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Aspect"
msgstr "Rasio aspek"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"4:3 is the arcade monitor's shape (the default).\n"
"Square pixels shows the raw 496x384 (slightly narrow).\n"
"16:9 (experimental) draws the 3D wider, with the 2D in the middle.\n"
"Stretch fills the whole window.\n"
"GPU renderers only. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"4:3 adalah bentuk monitor arcade (bawaan).\n"
"Piksel persegi menampilkan 496x384 mentah (sedikit sempit).\n"
"16:9 (eksperimental) menggambar 3D lebih lebar, 2D di tengah.\n"
"Regangkan memenuhi seluruh jendela.\n"
"Hanya renderer GPU. Langsung diterapkan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Brightness"
msgstr "Kecerahan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the Model 2 picture's black sits. 50% is the default,\n"
"matched to an arcade capture; lower is darker, higher is\n"
"brighter. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Letak hitam pada gambar Model 2. 50% adalah bawaan,\n"
"dicocokkan dengan rekaman mesin arcade; lebih rendah lebih gelap, lebih "
"tinggi lebih terang.\n"
"Langsung berlaku."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "CRT filter"
msgstr "Filter CRT"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A cosmetic arcade-monitor look over the finished frame:\n"
"scanlines, an RGB shadow mask, glow and optional screen\n"
"curvature. Purely visual; applies live."
msgstr ""
"Tampilan kosmetik monitor arcade di atas frame akhir:\n"
"scanline, shadow mask RGB, cahaya, dan kelengkungan layar\n"
"opsional. Murni visual; berlaku langsung."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scanlines"
msgstr "Scanline"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "Mask"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Glow"
msgstr "Cahaya"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Curvature"
msgstr "Kelengkungan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bezel"
msgstr "Bezel"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In fullscreen, frame the 4:3 picture with an image from\n"
"the bezels directory (Paths tab): <game>.png, the parent\n"
"set's, or default.png. The picture fills the image's\n"
"transparent window."
msgstr ""
"Dalam layar penuh, membingkai gambar 4:3 dengan gambar dari\n"
"direktori bezel (tab Jalur): <game>.png, milik set induk,\n"
"atau default.png. Gambar mengisi jendela transparan\n"
"pada gambar bezel."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enhancement (cosmetic, beyond the original hardware)"
msgstr "Peningkatan (kosmetik, melampaui perangkat keras asli)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropic"
msgstr "Anisotropik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Faithful"
msgstr "Setia"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "3D texture filter"
msgstr "Filter tekstur 3D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "(unsupported)"
msgstr "(tidak didukung)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This GPU does not report anisotropic filtering."
msgstr "GPU ini tidak melaporkan dukungan filter anisotropik."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Anisotropy"
msgstr "Anisotropi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "2D upscale"
msgstr "Upscale 2D"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Edge-smooth the 2D layers (HUD, text, menus). xBR and\n"
"ScaleFX round diagonals; Faithful keeps crisp pixels.\n"
"Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Haluskan tepi lapisan 2D (HUD, teks, menu). xBR dan\n"
"ScaleFX membulatkan diagonal; Setia menjaga piksel tajam.\n"
"Berlaku langsung."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Blended"
msgstr "Dicampur"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stipple"
msgstr "Stipple"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Translucency"
msgstr "Transparansi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The hardware draws see-through surfaces (lights, glass,\n"
"shadows) as a checkerboard. Blended draws the 50%\n"
"see-through surface it's trying to achieve. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Perangkat keras menggambar permukaan tembus pandang (lampu,\n"
"kaca, bayangan) sebagai pola papan catur. Dicampur menggambar\n"
"permukaan 50% tembus pandang yang dituju. Berlaku langsung."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Extended draw distance"
msgstr "Jarak gambar diperluas"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Draw the scenery to the edge of the course instead of\n"
"the arcade's short range, so it no longer pops in.\n"
"Daytona USA only. Applies live."
msgstr ""
"Menggambar pemandangan sampai tepi lintasan, bukan\n"
"hanya jangkauan pendek mesin arkade, jadi tidak muncul tiba-tiba lagi.\n"
"Hanya Daytona USA. Langsung berlaku."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Custom textures"
msgstr "Tekstur kustom"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Replace the game's 3D textures with images saved in\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, named as dumped. GPU\n"
"renderers only; Reload picks up edited files."
msgstr ""
"Ganti tekstur 3D game dengan gambar yang disimpan di\n"
"saves/textures/<game>/load, dengan nama hasil dump. Hanya\n"
"renderer GPU; Muat ulang membaca berkas yang diedit."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "%zu loaded"
msgstr "%zu dimuat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reload"
msgstr "Muat ulang"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dump textures"
msgstr "Dump tekstur"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Collect every 3D texture the game draws and write them,\n"
"with an index.html to browse, to saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"when the game exits or this is turned off."
msgstr ""
"Kumpulkan setiap tekstur 3D yang digambar game dan tulis,\n"
"dengan index.html untuk menelusuri, ke saves/textures/<game>/dump\n"
"saat game ditutup atau opsi ini dimatikan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Audio"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "Jalur"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Telusuri..."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Config directory"
msgstr "Direktori konfigurasi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where keisho.ini is read from and saved to.\n"
"Set with --config <dir>; cannot be changed here."
msgstr ""
"Tempat keisho.ini dibaca dan disimpan.\n"
"Diatur dengan --config <dir>; tidak dapat diubah di sini."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROM directory"
msgstr "Direktori ROM"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the ROM archives live. A game launched by name is\n"
"loaded from here as <name>.zip or <name>.7z."
msgstr ""
"Tempat arsip ROM berada. Game yang diluncurkan dengan nama\n"
"dimuat dari sini sebagai <name>.zip atau <name>.7z."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Model 1 ROM directory"
msgstr "Direktori ROM Model 1"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the Model 1 ROM archives live.\n"
"Empty means the ROM directory."
msgstr ""
"Tempat arsip ROM Model 1 berada.\n"
"Kosong berarti direktori ROM."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Model 3 ROM directory"
msgstr "Direktori ROM Model 3"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where the Model 3 ROM archives live.\n"
"Empty means the ROM directory."
msgstr ""
"Tempat arsip ROM Model 3 berada.\n"
"Kosong berarti direktori ROM."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Saves directory"
msgstr "Direktori simpanan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Battery-backed saves: per-game NVRAM (.nv) and EEPROM\n"
"(.eeprom) images -- high scores and operator settings."
msgstr ""
"Simpanan berbaterai: image NVRAM (.nv) dan EEPROM (.eeprom)\n"
"per game -- skor tertinggi dan pengaturan operator."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Screenshots directory"
msgstr "Direktori tangkapan layar"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where screenshots are written."
msgstr "Tempat tangkapan layar ditulis."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Bezels directory"
msgstr "Direktori bezel"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Bezel images: <game>.png, the parent set's, or default.png.\n"
"Empty means a bezels folder beside keisho.ini."
msgstr ""
"Gambar bezel: <game>.png, milik set induk, atau default.png.\n"
"Kosong berarti folder bezels di samping keisho.ini."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Crosshairs directory"
msgstr "Folder crosshair"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Crosshair images: <game>-p1.png (-p2 for player 2) or\n"
"<game>.png for both, then the parent set's, then default.\n"
"Drawn at their own size on a 1080-line picture. Without\n"
"one the built-in crosshair is drawn.\n"
"Empty means a crosshairs folder beside keisho.ini."
msgstr ""
"Gambar crosshair: <game>-p1.png (-p2 untuk pemain 2) atau\n"
"<game>.png untuk keduanya, lalu milik set induk, lalu default.\n"
"Digambar pada ukurannya sendiri di gambar 1080 baris. Tanpa\n"
"itu, crosshair bawaan yang digambar.\n"
"Kosong berarti folder crosshairs di samping keisho.ini."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scrape artwork online"
msgstr "Ambil artwork secara online"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Let the game picker fetch box art and descriptions from\n"
"ArcadeDB over the network. Off keeps Keisho offline: the\n"
"picker still lists and launches every game, with placeholder\n"
"tiles and no descriptions."
msgstr ""
"Biarkan pemilih game mengambil sampul dan deskripsi dari\n"
"ArcadeDB melalui jaringan. Mati membuat Keisho tetap offline:\n"
"pemilih tetap menampilkan dan meluncurkan semua game, dengan\n"
"gambar pengganti dan tanpa deskripsi."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gamepad"
msgstr "Gamepad"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Wheel"
