"pintasan mencantumkan kombinasi Guide."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The left stick also moves; the shoulders also act as Button 3/4. Right Lever "
"is Virtual On's. Show shortcuts lists the Guide combinations."
msgstr ""
"Stik kiri juga menggerakkan; tombol bahu juga berfungsi sebagai Button 3/4. "
"Tuas Kanan untuk Virtual On. Tampilkan pintasan mencantumkan kombinasi Guide."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick deadzone"
msgstr "Zona mati stik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Stick travel about centre that reads as centre. The bar shows\n"
"the stick now: let go of it and raise this until the marker\n"
"sits inside the shaded zone. Also applies to stick aiming."
msgstr ""
"Gerak stik di sekitar tengah yang dibaca sebagai tengah. Bilah menunjukkan\n"
"stik saat ini: lepaskan, lalu naikkan nilai ini sampai penanda\n"
"berada di dalam zona yang diarsir. Juga berlaku untuk membidik dengan stik."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick position"
msgstr "Posisi stik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Stick sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensitivitas stik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Response of a stick's travel past its deadzone. Full deflection\n"
"is always full lock; under 100% the middle of the travel does\n"
"less, over 100% it does more."
msgstr ""
"Respons gerakan stik melewati deadzone. Defleksi penuh\n"
"selalu kunci penuh; di bawah 100% bagian tengah gerakan\n"
"berefek lebih kecil, di atas 100% lebih besar."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Vibrates on the game's impacts in driving games.\n"
"Other games stay quiet."
msgstr ""
"Bergetar saat benturan dalam game balap.\n"
"Game lain tetap diam."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Steering vibration"
msgstr "Getaran kemudi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An added vibration that grows as you steer. It is not\n"
"from the game. Turn it off to feel only the game's force feedback."
msgstr ""
"Getaran tambahan yang meningkat saat Anda berbelok. Ini bukan\n"
"dari game. Matikan untuk merasakan hanya force feedback game."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Atur ulang"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Music volume"
msgstr "Volume musik"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Only for games with a separate music board: Star Wars\n"
"Arcade, Sega Touring Car Championship and Top Skater.\n"
"Sound effects stay as they are."
msgstr ""
"Hanya untuk game dengan papan musik terpisah:\n"
"Star Wars Arcade, Sega Touring Car Championship, Top Skater.\n"
"Efek suara tetap seperti semula."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Per-game volume"
msgstr "Volume per game"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Raise or lower a game's volume from its default level.\n"
"One slider covers every revision of a game. Off plays\n"
"every game at its default, whatever the sliders say.\n"
"\n"
"Warning: above 100% loud effects can clip (audible\n"
"distortion)."
msgstr ""
"Naikkan atau turunkan volume game dari level bawaannya.\n"
"Satu slider mencakup semua revisi sebuah game. Mati\n"
"memainkan semua game pada level bawaan, apa pun slidernya.\n"
"\n"
"Peringatan: di atas 100% efek keras bisa clipping (distorsi\n"
"yang terdengar)."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Now playing: %s"
msgstr "Sedang diputar: %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Reset all"
msgstr "Atur ulang semua"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Volume"
msgstr "Volume"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Auto"
msgstr "Otomatis"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Mati"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "On"
msgstr "Nyala"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gun mode"
msgstr "Mode senjata"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The aiming crosshair, with the mouse pointer hidden.\n"
"Auto turns it on in a gun game; On hides the pointer in\n"
"every game; Off never shows a crosshair."
msgstr ""
"Crosshair bidik, dengan penunjuk mouse disembunyikan.\n"
"Otomatis menyalakannya di game senjata; Nyala menyembunyikan\n"
"penunjuk di semua game; Mati tak pernah menampilkan crosshair."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Show crosshair"
msgstr "Tampilkan crosshair"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Draw Keisho's own crosshair. Turn off if the gun\n"
"has its own sight (e.g. a Sinden). Positional-gun\n"
"titles always draw their own regardless."
msgstr ""
"Gambar crosshair milik Keisho. Matikan jika senjata\n"
"punya bidikan sendiri (mis. Sinden). Game senjata\n"
"posisional selalu menggambar milik sendiri."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centred stick aim"
msgstr "Bidikan stik terpusat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A gamepad's stick points at the screen: the crosshair\n"
"sits in the centre at rest and reaches the edge at full\n"
"tilt. Off, the stick moves the crosshair like a mouse."
msgstr ""
"Stik gamepad menunjuk ke layar: crosshair\n"
"di tengah saat diam dan mencapai tepi saat dimiringkan penuh.\n"
"Mati, stik menggerakkan crosshair seperti mouse."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hide shot flash"
msgstr "Sembunyikan kilatan tembakan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Hide the white flash Virtua Cop, Virtua Cop 2 and\n"
"House of the Dead show on each shot."
msgstr ""
"Sembunyikan kilatan putih yang ditampilkan Virtua Cop,\n"
"Virtua Cop 2, dan House of the Dead setiap tembakan."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By default player 1 aims with the mouse (the left button fires and the right "
"reloads by shooting off screen) and player 2 with a gamepad."
msgstr "Secara bawaan pemain 1 membidik dengan mouse (tombol kiri menembak dan tombol kanan mengisi ulang dengan menembak ke luar layar) dan pemain 2 dengan gamepad."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Recoil"
msgstr "Hentakan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Kick the gun's rumble motor on each shot, for guns\n"
"that have one (Sinden and similar). No effect on a\n"
"gun without a motor."
msgstr ""
"Aktifkan motor getar senjata pada setiap tembakan, untuk\n"
"senjata yang memilikinya (Sinden dan sejenisnya). Tidak\n"
"berefek pada senjata tanpa motor."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Enable recoil"
msgstr "Aktifkan hentakan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Strength"
msgstr "Kekuatan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Devices"
msgstr "Perangkat"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Gun %zu (player %zu): %s"
msgstr "Senjata %zu (pemain %zu): %s"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"in absolute mouse mode (GUN4IR, Sinden, AimTrak) before launching for "
"independent per-player aiming."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada light gun khusus terdeteksi. Pemain 1 membidik dengan mouse; "
"tombol kiri menembak dan tombol kanan mengisi ulang (tembak ke luar layar). "
"Colokkan senjata dalam mode mouse absolut (GUN4IR, Sinden, AimTrak) sebelum "
"meluncurkan untuk bidikan terpisah per pemain."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No dedicated light guns detected. Player 1 aims with the mouse; the left "
"button fires and the right button reloads (shoot off screen). Plug in guns "
"tagged ID_INPUT_GUN for independent per-player aiming."
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada light gun khusus terdeteksi. Pemain 1 membidik dengan mouse; "
"tombol kiri menembak dan tombol kanan mengisi ulang (tembak ke luar layar). "
"Colokkan senjata bertanda ID_INPUT_GUN untuk bidikan terpisah per pemain."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Gun buttons"
msgstr "Tombol senjata"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Press Bind, then press the button on that player's gun."
msgstr "Tekan Tetapkan, lalu tekan tombol di senjata pemain itu."

