msgstr "Ketebalan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link cabinets over the network"
msgstr "Hubungkan kabinet melalui jaringan"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Race linked with other machines on the same LAN running the same\n"
"title (Sega Rally, Daytona, Super GT 24h, Indy 500, ...). Off keeps\n"
"this cabinet standalone. Takes effect on the next game launch."
msgstr ""
"Balapan terhubung dengan mesin lain di LAN yang sama yang menjalankan\n"
"judul yang sama (Sega Rally, Daytona, Super GT 24h, Indy 500, ...). Mati\n"
"membuat kabinet ini berdiri sendiri. Berlaku pada peluncuran game berikutnya."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The comms board is a ring: each cabinet listens on its own address and sends "
"to the next cabinet. For two machines, point each at the other. The master/"
"slave role is chosen in the game's own test menu, not here."
msgstr ""
"Papan komunikasi berbentuk cincin: setiap kabinet mendengarkan di alamatnya "
"sendiri dan mengirim ke kabinet berikutnya. Untuk dua mesin, arahkan masing-"
"masing ke yang lain. Peran master/slave dipilih di menu tes milik game, "
"bukan di sini."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "This cabinet"
msgstr "Kabinet ini"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Local IP"
msgstr "IP lokal"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Detect"
msgstr "Deteksi"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This machine's address on the cabinet LAN. Blank\n"
"listens on every interface. Detect fills it from the\n"
"primary network adapter."
msgstr ""
"Alamat mesin ini di LAN kabinet. Kosong berarti\n"
"mendengarkan di semua antarmuka. Deteksi mengisinya\n"
"dari adaptor jaringan utama."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Subnet mask"
msgstr "Subnet mask"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Listen port"
msgstr "Port dengar"

