#, no-c-format
msgid "Cabinet number"
msgstr "Nomor kabinet"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Where this cabinet sits in the ring (0-based).\n"
"For your own bookkeeping; the game negotiates the\n"
"actual link id from the ring."
msgstr ""
"Posisi kabinet ini di cincin (mulai dari 0).\n"
"Untuk catatan Anda sendiri; game menegosiasikan\n"
"ID link sebenarnya dari cincin."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Link delay (frames)"
msgstr "Tunda tautan (frame)"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Model 3 only. How many frames late the other cabinets'\n"
"data is read. Raise it if a race over Wi-Fi stutters;\n"
"lower it on a wired LAN. Each frame shows the other\n"
"cars 1/60 s later."
msgstr ""
"Hanya Model 3. Berapa frame terlambat data kabinet\n"
"lain dibaca. Naikkan jika balapan lewat Wi-Fi\n"
"tersendat; turunkan pada LAN kabel. Setiap frame\n"
"menampilkan mobil lain 1/60 detik lebih lambat."

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next cabinet in the ring"
msgstr "Kabinet berikutnya di cincin"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next IP"
msgstr "IP berikutnya"

#: src/osd/gui.cpp
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The cabinet this one sends to. For two machines, the\n"
"other machine's IP. Blank means this cabinet does not\n"
"forward (tail of a chain)."
msgstr ""
"Kabinet tujuan pengiriman kabinet ini. Untuk dua mesin,\n"
"IP mesin lainnya. Kosong berarti kabinet ini tidak\n"
"meneruskan (ujung rantai)."

